# SparkE Portal - Project Details for Resume

## 🏢 Project Overview
**Sparke** is an **EV Charging Station Management Portal** (CPO - Charge Point Operator Platform) - A comprehensive web application for managing electric vehicle charging infrastructure. This is an enterprise-level SaaS platform with multi-tenant architecture supporting different user roles.

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

### Frontend
| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| **React 17** | Core UI Framework |
| **Redux + Redux-Saga** | State Management |
| **React Router DOM v5** | Client-side Routing |
| **Material-UI (MUI v4/v5)** | UI Component Library |
| **React Hook Form** | Form Handling |
| **Axios** | HTTP Client |
| **ECharts / echarts-for-react** | Data Visualization & Charts |
| **Google Maps API** | Location/Mapping Features |
| **SASS/SCSS** | CSS Preprocessor |
| **Storybook** | Component Documentation |
| **Jest + React Testing Library** | Unit Testing |

### DevOps & Build
| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| **Docker** | Containerization |
| **Nginx** | Web Server (Production) |
| **Node.js 16** | Runtime Environment |

---

## 👥 User Roles (RBAC)
1. **Super Admin** - Full system access
2. **CPO Admin** - Network operator administration
3. **Enterprise Admin** - Enterprise-level management
4. **Corporate Admin** - Corporate account management
5. **Operator** - Day-to-day operations
6. **Field Operator** - On-site technician
7. **Corporate User / Driver** - End-user access

---

## 📱 Key Features & Modules

### 1. Dashboard & Analytics
- Real-time charging station statistics
- CPO-specific dashboards
- Widget-based data visualization
- Energy consumption reports

### 2. Network Management (CPO)
- Network-wide monitoring
- Multi-site management

### 3. Assets Management
- **Site Management** - Charging station locations
- **Charger Management** - EV chargers (with diagnostics)
- **Vehicle Management** - Fleet/EV assets
- **Accessories** - Supporting equipment

### 4. Charging Operations
- Charger configuration & monitoring
- Port-level management
- Real-time charger status
- Remote diagnostics & control (OCPP protocols)
- Charging profiles management

### 5. Transaction & Billing
- Transaction monitoring
- Pricing plan management (time-based, dynamic)
- Subscription plans
- Reconciliation reports

### 6. User Management
- Multi-role user management
- User allocation & permissions
- Driver management

### 7. Customer Management
- CPO/Network providers
- Enterprise customers
- Corporate accounts

### 8. Reports & Analytics
- Charger reports
- Energy reports
- Session reports
- Site reports
- Enterprise reports
- Transaction reports

### 9. Alerts & Notifications
- Real-time alerts system
- Multi-channel notifications

### 10. Support & Diagnostics
- Remote diagnostics (OCPP based)
- Service request management
- Firmware updates
- Configuration management

### 11. Reconciliation
- Financial reconciliation
- Configuration management
- Reporting

---

## 🔧 Technical Highlights

### Architecture
- **Multi-tenant SaaS** architecture
- **Role-based access control (RBAC)**
- **Protected routes** with authentication
- **Dynamic form generation** (Form Generator pattern)
- **Lazy loading** for performance

### API Integration
- RESTful API consumption
- JWT-based authentication
- Token management service
- Axios interceptors for auth

### UI/UX Features
- Responsive design (mobile-friendly)
- Dark/Light theming support
- Internationalization (i18n ready)
- Custom form components
- Data tables with filtering/pagination
- Charts and visualizations
- Map integration (Google Maps)
- PDF/CSV export capabilities

### Testing
- Unit testing with Jest
- Component testing with React Testing Library
- Snapshot testing
- Coverage reporting (SonarQube)

